### 12. Update Device (Clear Relationships)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/devices/5
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceAuth.response.body.token}}

{
  "ip_addresses": [24],
  "tags": [],
  "contacts": []
}

### 13. Delete Device
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/devices/{{createDeviceComplete.response.body.data.id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceAuth.response.body.token}}
# Expected: 200 OK with { success: true, message: "Device deleted successfully" }

